1
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:01,720
If you had said something earlier,

2
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:03,920
so many people wouldn't have been hurt.

3
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:06,120
I was afraid they would find me.

4
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,560
They are a bunch of animals.

5
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:09,420
We will go to the police tomorrow.

6
00:01:11,039 --> 00:01:12,240
We can't let them call the police.

7
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:13,039
Who's there?

8
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:16,720
Siyao.

9
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:18,920
Yesterday...

10
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:20,360
Are you okay?

11
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:21,240
I'm fine.

12
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,250
You didn't get sick?

13
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,240
No.

14
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:30,000
I...

15
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:32,360
Ye Shi'an.

16
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:34,050
This is the police station.

17
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,240
Let me see, let me see.

18
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,520
Do you have a cold?

19
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:54,960
Where am I?

20
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:56,920
A hotel.

21
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,280
Why am I here?

22
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:02,260
You drank too much last night.

23
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,960
And it was raining heavily outside.

24
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,490
I could only bring you here.

25
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:08,960
You.

26
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,520
Come here.

27
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:18,240
Speak.

28
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,720
You won't bite or hit me, right?

29
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:23,640
Serves you right.

30
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,240
You long-faced sour pickle.

31
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,920
We are a man and a woman alone in a room.

32
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:29,579
Look at your clothes. I didn't touch them at all.

33
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:31,300
Aren't you being a bit greedy?

34
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:34,360
Then why are you dressed like that?

35
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,890
Who knows what you did to me?

36
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:42,960
Look and smell for yourself.

37
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,440
You drank too much last night and threw up all over my leg.

38
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:46,760
I kindly brought you here.

39
00:02:46,760 --> 00:02:47,800
And you slapped me

40
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:48,800
and poked my eyes.

41
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,440
You little potato.

42
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:50,360
Do you have a conscience?

43
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,490
What did you call me?

44
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:52,650
Do you not want to...

45
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,280
Stop messing around.

46
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,010
We're going to be late for work.

47
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,920
That night,

48
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:01,360
I helped him escape from the winery.

49
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:04,500
After that, we didn't dare to show our faces.

50
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,320
We worked as coolies at the dock.

51
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:08,450
But we couldn't even get enough to eat.

52
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:11,260
So Wei Xiaodong finally fled back to the winery.

53
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:13,200
And then the rest happened.

54
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:15,240
So they are a group of people,

55
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,700
not just one or two, right?

56
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:17,720
Right.

57
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,840
They are a secret organization,

58
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,240
which includes many of the concession's

59
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,970
dignitaries and celebrities.

60
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,720
They are committing crimes collectively.

61
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,320
You must find their organization.

62
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,400
So the St. Faci Winery

63
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,600
is their stronghold.

64
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,160
Right.

65
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,680
They all have a

66
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,410
colorful banded krait tattoo.

67
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:35,960
But George didn't have that tattoo on him.

68
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,560
Impossible.

69
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,200
He had a tattoo on him.

70
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:48,440
I'm sure he did.

71
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,960
He was such an important witness.

72
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,760
Why wasn't he eliminated in advance?

73
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:54,680
I couldn't find him.

74
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,680
It was my mistake.

75
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,160
Read it to me.

76
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,260
What took you guys so long?

77
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,120
I overslept.

78
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:11,120
Overslept.

79
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:13,240
Why did you two come together?

80
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:15,160
It's you, Zhou Wei.

81
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,839
We bumped into each other at the door.

82
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:20,040
I read Zhao Bin's statement.

83
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:22,040
Let's talk about the case.

84
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:24,040
There's still one suspicious point.

85
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,520
When we went to the church that day,

86
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:27,520
we didn't see any tattoos on George.

87
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:30,040
Even if it was removed somehow,

88
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:32,170
it couldn't have left no trace.

89
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,000
Let's leave that for now.

90
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:36,500
Let's investigate Shengfaxi Winery first.

91
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,560
That Shengfaxi Winery

92
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,760
is different from other ordinary places in the concession.

93
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:42,920
High officials, dignitaries,

94
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,640
and celebrities from all walks of life frequent it,

95
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:46,640
so it's often guarded by patrolmen.

96
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,240
Even with orders from above, it might be difficult.

97
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:50,170
Then we'll investigate in secret.

98
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:52,440
We've already made enough noise.

99
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,760
If we get caught again,

100
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,640
it wouldn't be good to cause a diplomatic incident.

101
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:57,159
But that's the only clue.

102
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:58,770
We have to investigate.

103
00:04:59,159 --> 00:05:00,360
Get ready for action.

104
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,920
Bai Weng, go to this place immediately

105
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,400
and protect Zhao Bin and his wife.

106
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,240
Young Master.

107
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,640
The person you asked me to look into,

108
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:07,520
I've found him.

109
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:10,320
No wonder

110
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:12,560
he looked at me in a special way.

111
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,600
Huang Xianzhong,

112
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,400
former chief of the police station.

113
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:17,520
He and the Master used to be classmates.

114
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:19,520
You now look very much like

115
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,240
the Master when he was young.

116
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,440
When you were a child,

117
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,240
he saw you.

118
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:24,440
Perhaps

119
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,960
he has already recognized you.

120
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:26,760
Young Master.

121
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,320
Don't go to the police station anymore.

122
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:29,520
It's too dangerous there.

123
00:05:29,520 --> 00:05:30,440
Have you forgotten

124
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,800
how the Master died?

125
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,320
I will never forget

126
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,380
how my father died.

127
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:36,000
When he was brought back

128
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,040
from Shengfaxi Winery,

129
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,170
he was already dead.

130
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,600
He died of potassium cyanide poisoning.

131
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,600
I study chemistry

132
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:43,159
for this very reason.

133
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:45,040
Those people protect each other

134
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,300
and cover up the truth.

135
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,040
We are tucked away in a corner,

136
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:50,200
and it's already hard enough to hold onto Xinfeng Stronghold.

137
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:50,800
Bai Weng,

138
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,640
have you forgotten why I became a policeman?

139
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,040
Since I chose to be a policeman,

140
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,640
it's not just for revenge,

141
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,450
but to find out the truth

142
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,130
and clear my father's name.

143
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,280
Don't worry.

144
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,290
I will live a long and safe life.

145
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:04,370
I still have people to protect.

146
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:10,480
It's so late.

147
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,640
Where are you going?

148
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,640
Since when did you start caring about where I go?

149
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:14,480
Don't forget,

150
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,260
I am the head of the Huo family.

151
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:17,640
Right.

152
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:20,600
It seems you really didn't take

153
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,460
what I said to you before to heart.

154
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:25,040
This case cannot be investigated anymore.

155
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,040
Do you know something?

156
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:30,040
What you are doing now

157
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:32,680
is something the police department and the patrol station

158
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,080
strictly prohibit.

159
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,760
You're asking me what I want to know?

160
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,890
I only know that I'm worried about you.

161
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,840
Have you been to Shengfaxi Winery?

162
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:40,560
Where?

163
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:42,200
Shengwaxi.

164
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,480
Never.

165
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,659
What kind of filthy place is this?

166
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:48,570
Can you just stop getting involved with them?

167
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,800
Then tell me,

168
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,320
what do you think I should do?

169
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:53,640
You should be cultivating in the mountains.

170
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:55,200
In this Phoenix City,

171
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:58,400
be the head of the Huo family, the biggest merchant.

172
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,250
Your expectations of me

173
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,000
are very wrong.

174
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,160
Alright.

175
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,440
Say no more.

176
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:07,320
You can't go out tonight anyway.

177
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,200
Fine.

178
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:09,200
Why?

179
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:11,520
Can't I just be an ordinary daughter?

180
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:12,400
No.

181
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:16,520
Becoming the head of the Huo family is your destiny.

182
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:19,600
Becoming the protector of the Huo family is mine.

183
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,360
Keep an eye on her tonight.

184
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,560
Don't let her go out.

185
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:30,240
Miss,

186
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,200
don't make things difficult for us.

187
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,040
Get out.

188
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,300
Why isn't Huo Yining here yet?

189
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:46,100
Lord Huo probably won't let her come.

190
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,570
But that's for the best.

191
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:48,840
That's not right.

192
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:49,880
Given her personality,

193
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:50,880
she looks fierce,

194
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:53,400
but is actually full of righteousness.

195
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:53,920
No.

196
00:07:54,159 --> 00:07:54,920
She must be in danger.

197
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,760
I have to go save her.

198
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:57,400
She's the head of the Huo family.

199
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,860
How could she be in danger?

200
00:07:59,440 --> 00:07:59,840
Makes sense.

201
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:01,100
I understand Lord Huo.

202
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,840
Selfishly speaking,

203
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:05,100
I don't want her to take risks either.

204
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:07,240
Why is it so quiet?

205
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,200
Is she asleep?

206
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,040
Miss.

207
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:10,360
Miss.

208
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:11,440
Oh no.

209
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:14,130
Inspector Zhou.

210
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:16,600
This trip to Shengfaxi Winery

211
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:19,240
is forbidden by both the police station and the patrol room.

212
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:21,640
You could very well lose your job over this.

213
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:22,960
If you want to leave,

214
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,560
I won't have any complaints.

215
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,840
If I were timid,

216
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:29,040
I wouldn't have gotten involved in the Jingxiang Society case.

217
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:29,570
However,

218
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,560
since Huo Yining isn't here,

219
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:33,400
on this journey to find the truth,

220
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:35,880
it will just be Superintendent Jiang and me, Zhou Wei.

221
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:36,740
In your dreams.

222
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,159
At a time like this,

223
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,780
how could you leave me out?

224
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:41,120
As long as my senior sister is here,

225
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:43,450
I, the little Taoist nun, will be here too.

226
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:45,570
Where's the little bandit?

227
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:47,530
I have other arrangements for him.

228
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,280
Let's go.

229
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:14,760
Oh no.

230
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,200
It's a trap.

231
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,840
Coming.

232
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:23,170
Mrs. Liu.

233
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,280
Has Siyao returned?

234
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:25,000
No.

235
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:25,840
She didn't come back last night.

236
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:26,500
This is bad.

237
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:27,760
Something happened.

238
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:38,640
Don't even think about getting out of here.

239
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,160
On charges of trespassing in the concession

240
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:41,480
and murder,

241
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,960
I will send you to the concession court.

242
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,040
Miss Jiang,

243
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:46,240
I told you that you would experience

244
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,520
a British prison.

245
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,760
It seems the Lord really blesses you.

246
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,560
Every step we take

247
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:56,620
can be anticipated by the other side.

248
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:57,770
There must be a mole.

249
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,040
But Li Chengrui

250
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,960
was not involved in this incident at all.

251
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:02,160
Who would have known we were coming to St. Faci?

252
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:03,320
That's because Mayor Zeng

253
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:05,040
explicitly forbade us from investigating.

254
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:05,840
Then,

255
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:08,120
we interrogated Zhao Bin at the police station.

256
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,480
Maybe at that time,

257
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:11,160
we were already being watched.

258
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,160
Then both Li Chengrui

259
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:13,920
and Mayor Zeng are suspects.

260
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,320
I'm sure

261
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:17,840
it's definitely a high-ranking official.

262
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:18,760
It's just that

263
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,600
we can't investigate anymore.

264
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,320
Locked up here,

265
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,650
we really can't get out.

266
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,320
Since you recognized me, Uncle Huang,

267
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,360
you should have guessed

268
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,920
why I became a police officer.

269
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:35,720
Nephew,

270
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,120
long time no see.

271
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:39,200
I thought your Duan family

272
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:40,940
had left Phoenix City,

273
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:43,240
gone far away,

274
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,800
and stayed out of worldly affairs.

275
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:45,400
After all,

276
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:48,360
when your father died,

277
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,840
that was what he hoped for.

278
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:50,720
His long-cherished wish

279
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:51,960
was to forge weapons more powerful

280
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,620
than those of the foreigners.

281
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:54,850
Unfortunately,

282
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,480
before it could be realized,

283
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:57,920
he passed away.

284
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,130
What he left behind,

285
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,440
I will carry out.

286
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:04,040
You've hidden for so long.

287
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,660
Why did you suddenly come to me today?

288
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:07,840
You know that

289
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:11,520
if Zeng Guoquan finds out you're still alive,

290
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:15,040
he will eliminate you completely.

291
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:17,640
Siyao and the others went to San Faci Winery last night

292
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:18,760
and are still missing.

293
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,200
My people can't find them either,

294
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:22,660
so I can only come to ask Uncle Huang for help.

295
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:25,180
Such a thing happened?

296
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,600
Okay.

297
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:29,760
I'll go ask around.
